  "clinical_evidence": [
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Well, I woke at about six and found my left arm and leg felt rather weak. Heavy, you might say. It was quite sudden, or rather, it was there as soon as I woke.",
      "start_timestamp": "00:35",
      "end_timestamp": "00:53",
      "supports": [
        "chief_complaint",
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "So you woke up with weakness down your left side. Did you notice it before you went to bed?",
      "start_timestamp": "00:55",
      "end_timestamp": "01:04",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "About three hours. It was worse when I first stood up. It has eased slightly since, but I would not say it has gone.",
      "start_timestamp": "01:23",
      "end_timestamp": "01:37",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Exactly right, doctor.",
      "start_timestamp": "01:53",
      "end_timestamp": "01:55",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Fair enough. Now I need to ask about your speech. Any problem with your speech, finding words or slurring?",
      "start_timestamp": "02:17",
      "end_timestamp": "02:28",
      "supports": [
        "negative_findings[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "No. My wife says I sound entirely like myself, which she does not always mean as a compliment.",
      "start_timestamp": "02:31",
      "end_timestamp": "02:41",
      "supports": [
        "negative_findings[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Yes. Your face looks even on both sides. Now hold both arms out in front of you, palms up, and squeeze my fingers with each hand in turn.",
      "start_timestamp": "03:30",
      "end_timestamp": "03:46",
      "supports": [
        "physical_examination[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "I can feel that you squeeze with both hands, and the strength in both arms is equal. Thank you.",
      "start_timestamp": "03:55",
      "end_timestamp": "04:07",
      "supports": [
        "physical_examination[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Then here's the honest part. We watch it carefully. If any of these happen, you must not wait and see: your face drops on one side, your speech goes slurred or muddled, or the weakness gets worse. In that case you call 999 immediately.",
      "start_timestamp": "04:43",
      "end_timestamp": "05:05",
      "supports": [
        "clinical_actions[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Then that is settled. Now, if it hasn't gone away within three days, I want you back here to see me, even if you feel it's improving.",
      "start_timestamp": "05:55",
      "end_timestamp": "06:11",
      "supports": [
        "clinical_actions[1]",
        "follow_up[0]"
      ]
    }
